# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and check it out as LF on
# every platform. Without this, a Windows clone with `core.autocrlf=true` (git's
# default there) rewrites the working tree to CRLF, and the frontmatter parsing
# in test/skills.test.js fails for every skill: 65 red tests that say nothing
# about the code. Every file tracked here is already LF in the index, so this
# changes no committed content, only how it lands on disk.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
